Package: duo-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Duo Desktop <noreply@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/davidm052006/duo-desktop
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libx11-6, libxi6, libgl1, libnss3, libnspr4, libgbm1, libdrm2, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxrandr2, libxkbcommon0, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libatk1.0-0 | libatk1.0-0t64, libcups2 | libcups2t64, libasound2 | libasound2t64, xclip
Description: Desktop workspace for coordinating AI agents
 Duo Desktop is a Flutter Linux application for coordinating ChatGPT,
 Codex and Claude Code over the same repository with visible task state,
 branches and review flow.
